{"title":"Dragonscale Feet","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tailoring Lv 46)</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 40 · INT/MAG 100 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tailoring at level 46 <span class=\"muted\">(2344 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/dragonscale-knick\">Dragonscale Knick</a>, 4× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div class=\"s muted\">No monster drops recorded for this item.</div>\n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/tailoring\">Tailoring</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-feet\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-feet?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-feet?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-feet?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-feet?q=ordinary\">Ordinary</a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-feet?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-feet?q=excellent\">Excellent</a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-feet?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-feet?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"dragonscale-feet\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"titan\">Titan</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"camel\">Camel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"weasel\">Weasel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"leopard\">Leopard</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"sage\">Sage</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"mage\">Mage</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Protection comes from the armor of all five pieces together, up to 75%.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>A full set of it protects</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/dragonscale-feet?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/7ce6de157efd9abd04f5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>0.8 armor · 2 magic defense</td><td>21% blows · 41% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/dragonscale-feet?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/7ce6de157efd9abd04f5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>0.9 armor · 2.3 magic defense</td><td>24% blows · 44% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/dragonscale-feet?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/7ce6de157efd9abd04f5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></td><td>-10%</td><td>1 armor · 2.6 magic defense</td><td>26% blows · 47% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/dragonscale-feet?q=ordinary\" title=\"Show it at Ordinary\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/7ce6de157efd9abd04f5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></td><td>0%</td><td>1.1 armor · 2.9 magic defense</td><td>28% blows · 50% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/dragonscale-feet?q=good\" title=\