ent\">Excellent</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></th><th><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>46 <span class=\"muted\">(+0)</span></td><td>1.5%</td><td>4.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>56.2%</td><td>16.2%</td><td>2.9%</td><td>0.2%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>51 <span class=\"muted\">(+5)</span></td><td>0.5%</td><td>2.4%</td><td>14.2%</td><td>55.7%</td><td>21.4%</td><td>5.1%</td><td>0.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>56 <span class=\"muted\">(+10)</span></td><td>0.1%</td><td>1.2%</td><td>10.0%</td><td>52.7%</td><td>26.4%</td><td>7.8%</td><td>1.7%</td><td>~0%</td></tr><tr><td>61 <span class=\"muted\">(+15)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.4%</td><td>6.6%</td><td>47.5%</td><td>30.8%</td><td>11.1%</td><td>3.5%</td><td>0.1%</td></tr><tr><td>66 <span class=\"muted\">(+20)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.1%</td><td>3.9%</td><td>40.8%</td><td>33.7%</td><td>15.1%</td><td>5.9%</td><td>0.6%</td></tr><tr><td>69 <span class=\"muted\">(+23)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>2.8%</td><td>36.3%</td><td>34.5%</td><td>17.5%</td><td>7.8%</td><td>1.2%</td></tr><tr><td>71 <span class=\"muted\">(+25)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>2.0%</td><td>33.3%</td><td>35.0%</td><td>19.1%</td><td>9.0%</td><td>1.6%</td></tr><tr><td>76 <span class=\"muted\">(+30)</span></td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.0%</td><td>0.8%</td><td>25.7%</td><td>34.7%</td><td>22.7%</td><td>12.8%</td><td>3.3%</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <p><b>Monster drops</b>: ordinary monsters and chests give at most Excellent; elites give only Excellent, Superior or Flawless (official guide).</p>\n      <p class=\"muted\">No Ordinary drops of it recorded yet.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/dragonscale-knick\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/620b30f073ef24409e0d.svg\" alt=\"\">Dragonscale Knick</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\